{bmatrix}.$\n\n$det(R)=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}|=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(R) & =|\\begin{aligned}-8 & 14 \\\\ -7 & 13\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-8)(13)-(14)(-7) \\\\  & =-104+98 \\\\  & =-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186510612 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f7510b5f-6370-56f3-aaeb-ffce4ec766ff" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-21" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510621}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-21" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510621} :answer-field/id #uuid "d775c716-9480-511e-b2f7-a5ea4fe55174" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510618}] :question/id #uuid "b02768f5-2401-5388-9659-b87f57ee6732" :question/problem "Calculate $det(A)$ given that\n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -12 \\\\ 7 & -15\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n$det(A)=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}|=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =|\\begin{aligned}7 & -12 \\\\ 7 & -15\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(7)(-15)-(-12)(7) \\\\  & =-105+84 \\\\  & =-21.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186510613 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "de85e9f7-1fad-524b-bd8b-7104cec09347" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-90" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510619}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-90" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510619} :answer-field/id #uuid "0d20830b-2284-575f-9545-dae95ed220c7" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510586}]